lilydev (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UX: hot-reload now preserves the PDF view: zoom and scroll
    position (vertical and horizontal) are captured right before the
    re-render and restored once the new pages are drawn.

 -- Gabriel Antonio Farías Ravanal <galileo.fandango@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:40:00 +0000

lilydev (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Perf: debounce file-watch events. Editors fire several inotify
    events per save; now all events in a burst (200 ms quiet window)
    trigger a single recompilation. Saves in vim went from ~5 s to
    ~2.3 s.

 -- Gabriel Antonio Farías Ravanal <galileo.fandango@gmail.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:10:00 +0000

lilydev (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix hot-reload: .ily files now trigger recompilation too, not just
    the main .ly file.

